{"id":1050101,"chapter_id":1050101,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"　　越过白砂之海，坐落在沙漠绿洲上的庞然大物——费沙城。\n　　是一座被坎贝尔家族所掌控的城市。","style":14,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101001,"trial_step":1},{"step":2,"content":"　　费沙城如今的主人，坎贝尔的第五任家主，是有史以来最心狠手辣的领导者。","style":14,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101002,"trial_step":2},{"step":3,"content":"　　他用短短八年时间，掌管了白砂之海98%的航路，以及与狄斯城的重要贸易渠道。\n　　——这彰显了他们，从未放弃过任何可能攻回狄斯城的机会。","style":14,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101003,"trial_step":3},{"step":4,"content":"你关上显示器，拿起了一旁第九机关给你准备的资料，准备去会会前几天逮捕的禁闭者，她被人举报指出，有与外邦勾结的嫌疑。","style":3,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101004,"trial_step":4},{"step":5,"content":"<color=#e45515>“不惜一切代价，挖出并证实她背后的靠山。”</color>\n——第九机关在将资料给你的同时，也对你提出了这样的要求。","style":3,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101005,"trial_step":5,"drawing":1050101},{"step":6,"speaker":"？？？","content":"您好，希望我们今天合作愉快。","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_8"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101008,"trial_step":8,"drawing":1050101},{"step":7,"content":"甫一进审查室，你便看到坐在椅子上的年轻女性朝你笑笑，对你打了个招呼。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101009,"trial_step":9,"drawing":1050101},{"step":8,"options":["回应她","不说话"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101010,"trial_step":10,"course":3,"drawing":1050101,"choices":[{"text":"回应她","goto":11},{"text":"不说话","goto":14}]},{"step":9,"speaker":"玩家","content":"您好，伊琳娜小姐，我也是这么希望的。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101011,"trial_step":11,"drawing":1050101},{"step":10,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"当然，我一定知无不言。","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_12"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101012,"trial_step":12,"drawing":1050101},{"step":11,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"我可不想给局长留下什么不好的印象。","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_13"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101013,"trial_step":13,"drawing":1050101,"next":[18]},{"step":12,"speaker":"？？？","content":"唉，我还以为我已经表现得足够有诚意了……","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_14"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101014,"trial_step":14,"drawing":1050101},{"step":13,"speaker":"？？？","content":"连招呼都不打……接下来可很难合作呀。","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_15"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101015,"trial_step":15,"drawing":1050101},{"step":14,"speaker":"？？？","content":"不过，我还是很希望能给你留下一个好的印象，局长。","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_16"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101016,"trial_step":16,"drawing":1050101},{"step":15,"speaker":"玩家","content":"只要你能好好配合，伊琳娜。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101017,"trial_step":17,"drawing":1050101,"next":[18]},{"step":16,"content":"看着端坐在审查椅上的女性，你其实并不是非常有信心，能与这位商业巨子周旋。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101018,"trial_step":18,"drawing":1050101},{"step":17,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"我大概知道，被您抓住的都是什么人。","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_19"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101019,"trial_step":19,"drawing":1050101},{"step":18,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"如您所见，我确实是个禁闭者。","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_20"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101020,"trial_step":20,"drawing":1050101},{"step":19,"content":"伊琳娜看着你手里那张薄薄的白纸，承认得非常直接。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101021,"trial_step":21,"drawing":1050101},{"step":20,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"但除了这个身份以外，我应该没有做任何有违法律规定的事情吧？","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_22"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101022,"trial_step":22,"drawing":1050101},{"step":21,"speaker":"玩家","content":"……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101023,"trial_step":23,"drawing":1050101},{"step":22,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"奎恩集团一年给狄斯城带了十几亿的税收，这都不配让我得到保释吗？","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_24"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101024,"trial_step":24,"drawing":1050102},{"step":23,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"哪怕您对我进行全方位的监测也可以，不过……我要是不在，奎恩的股价可就要下跌了。","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_25"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101025,"trial_step":25,"drawing":1050102},{"step":24,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"这恐怕会连带着很多东西一起，引起不必要的麻烦呀……","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_26"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101026,"trial_step":26,"drawing":1050102},{"step":25,"content":"像是很苦恼一般，伊琳娜悠悠地叹了口气。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101027,"trial_step":27,"drawing":1050102},{"step":26,"options":["我不需要了解这个"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101028,"trial_step":28,"course":3,"drawing":1050101,"choices":[{"text":"我不需要了解这个","goto":29}]},{"step":27,"speaker":"玩家","content":"我的职责并不是去研究一个多方发展的金融集团总裁，会影响到些什么。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101029,"trial_step":29,"drawing":1050101},{"step":28,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"好吧，既然如此，我们还是聊聊别的吧。只要你感兴趣，关于我的任何事……你都可以问。","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_30"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101030,"trial_step":30,"drawing":1050101},{"step":29,"speaker":"玩家","content":"感谢你的允许。那就来聊聊关于你的一些……传说吧。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101031,"trial_step":31,"drawing":1050101},{"step":30,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"新城人才辈出，想不到我竟然也能有传说了？","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_32"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101032,"trial_step":32,"drawing":1050101},{"step":31,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"传播的人或许也只是高看了我一眼吧？","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_33"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101033,"trial_step":33,"drawing":1050101},{"step":32,"speaker":"玩家","content":"不必谦虚，能在短短的八年间，将奎恩集团由一个默默无闻的小型企业，打造成如今的金融投资财团……你很厉害。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101034,"trial_step":34,"drawing":1050101},{"step":33,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"这并不是我一个人的功劳，是所有人努力的结果。","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_35"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101035,"trial_step":35,"drawing":1050101},{"step":34,"content":"伊琳娜轻声笑了笑，嘴里的说辞是所有企业家都会说的场面话。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101036,"trial_step":36,"drawing":1050101},{"step":35,"speaker":"玩家","content":"那也仰仗为首之人能运筹帷幄，决胜千里。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101037,"trial_step":37,"drawing":1050101},{"step":36,"content":"伊琳娜的眉眼微微一挑。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101038,"trial_step":38,"drawing":1050100},{"step":37,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"……过誉了。","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_39"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101039,"trial_step":39,"drawing":1050100},{"step":38,"speaker":"玩家","content":"在我们的规定中，若是精英人士被检测出禁闭者倾向，一般是不会立刻逮捕……除非……她动了一些她不该动的心思。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101040,"trial_step":40,"drawing":1050100},{"step":39,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"不该动的？","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_41"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101041,"trial_step":41,"drawing":1050100},{"step":40,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"奎恩集团的产业遍布狄斯城的方方面面……我还挺好奇的，我身边的一切有什么是我不能触碰的吗？","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_42"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101042,"trial_step":42,"drawing":1050101},{"step":41,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"啊——确实有，您现在就在我眼前，可我却没办法触碰您，真是可惜。","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_43"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101043,"trial_step":43,"drawing":1050101},{"step":42,"options":["您可真会开玩笑"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101044,"trial_step":44,"course":3,"drawing":1050101,"choices":[{"text":"您可真会开玩笑","goto":45}]},{"step":43,"speaker":"玩家","content":"我这番说辞，实际上也在给您一个忠告，伊琳娜小姐。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101045,"trial_step":45,"drawing":1050101},{"step":44,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"但撇去禁闭者的身份，我不过是一个安分守己的商人罢了。","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_46"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101046,"trial_step":46,"drawing":1050101},{"step":45,"speaker":"玩家","content":"抓捕你的第一原因是禁闭者，至于第二原因……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101047,"trial_step":47,"drawing":1050101},{"step":46,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置1","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":48,"course":6,"drawing":1050101},{"step":47,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置2","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":48,"course":6,"drawing":1050101},{"step":48,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置3","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":48,"course":6,"drawing":1050101},{"step":49,"options":["选择1"],"jump":[5],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":48,"course":6,"drawing":1050101},{"step":50,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置4","style":18,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":48,"course":6,"drawing":1050101},{"step":51,"options":["选择1","选择2"],"jump":[7,9],"style":4,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":48,"course":6,"drawing":1050101},{"step":52,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置5，对应选择1","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":48,"course":6,"drawing":1050101},{"step":53,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置5，对应选择2","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":48,"course":6,"drawing":1050101},{"step":54,"content":"那支录音笔放上来的一瞬间，伊琳娜的眉头微蹙。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101049,"trial_step":49,"drawing":1050100},{"step":55,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"生意场上，讲究的就是凭证与信任，看来一些商业伙伴对我的信任还不足够啊。","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_50"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101050,"trial_step":50,"drawing":1050100},{"step":56,"speaker":"玩家","content":"这很正常，就像您虽然对我很友善，但实际上并无信任。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101051,"trial_step":51,"drawing":1050100},{"step":57,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"说得对，我喜欢你的直白。","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_52"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101052,"trial_step":52,"drawing":1050100},{"step":58,"speaker":"玩家","content":"既然如此，您现在需要向我解释一下这份录音的内容。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101053,"trial_step":53,"drawing":1050100},{"step":59,"content":"你按下录音笔的按钮，跳过了一些无关紧要的对话内容，停在关键词前。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101054,"trial_step":54,"drawing":1050100},{"step":60,"speaker":"录音","content":"“连那位伊诺克议员，都认可你的成绩，所以我们都很看好你，认为你是有资格加入或是参与到涅槃的业务中来。”","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_55"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":11,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101055,"trial_step":55,"drawing":1050100},{"step":61,"speaker":"录音","content":"“哎，涅槃占据<color=#e45515>异方晶运输</color>很久了，是该有些新鲜血液进来了。”","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_56"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":11,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101056,"trial_step":56,"drawing":1050100},{"step":62,"speaker":"录音","content":"“感谢<color=#e45515>几位议员</color>如此看重我，如果我能得到这个资格，我甘愿承担应有的责任和风险。”","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_57"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":11,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101057,"trial_step":57,"drawing":1050100},{"step":63,"content":"录音中的伊琳娜滴水不漏，似乎眼前的利益与她完全无关。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101058,"trial_step":58,"drawing":1050100},{"step":64,"content":"不得不说，伊琳娜有着非常出色的谈判意识，任何一句可能会对自己造成风险的话都不会说。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101059,"trial_step":59,"drawing":1050100},{"step":65,"speaker":"玩家","content":"说说这几位议员的来历吧。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101061,"trial_step":61,"drawing":1050100},{"step":66,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"奎恩集团是维持新城运作必不可缺的一环，承蒙议员们的厚爱，我才偶有机会和他们说上两句话。","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_62"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101062,"trial_step":62,"drawing":1050100},{"step":67,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"虽然不知道这份录音是谁交上来的，但……我在这里可以很明确地告诉你。","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_63"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101063,"trial_step":63,"drawing":1050100},{"step":68,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"这些不过是上不了台面的玩笑话而已。我还没有不明智到主动去沾染异方晶，暴露自己禁闭者的身份。","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_64"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101064,"trial_step":64,"drawing":1050100},{"step":69,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"局长难道认为我会采用这样愚蠢的方案吗？呵，那看来……您也不过如此。","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_65"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101065,"trial_step":65,"drawing":1050100},{"step":70,"speaker":"玩家","content":"异方晶是目前全世界都赖以生存的重要资源，是决不允许私人染指的。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101068,"trial_step":68,"drawing":1050100},{"step":71,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"我知道，局长大人。但你也要清楚……我是个商人。","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_69"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101069,"trial_step":69,"drawing":1050100},{"step":72,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"在道德和法律的底线之上，商人要做的就是尽可能地追寻最大的商业价值和利润。","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_70"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101070,"trial_step":70,"drawing":1050100},{"step":73,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"异方晶的附加产业是一块巨大的肥肉。既然奎恩在开采和加工环节无法插手，自然便会把目光投在这些<b><color=#e45515>合法</color></b>的附加产业。","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_71"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101071,"trial_step":71,"drawing":1050100},{"step":74,"speaker":"玩家","content":"私人企业想要获得异方晶的运输权或者其他权限，几乎是不可能的。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101072,"trial_step":72,"drawing":1050100},{"step":75,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"但也只是“几乎”不可能，呵呵……","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_73"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101073,"trial_step":73,"drawing":1050100},{"step":76,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"普通人会有这么武断的判定，不过是因为门槛太高，为自己找一个“没有资格”的借口，但实际上……它并非遥不可及。","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_74"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101074,"trial_step":74,"drawing":1050100},{"step":77,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"那些议员也不过是看好奎恩的股票和实力，这般试探罢了。","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_75"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101075,"trial_step":75,"drawing":1050100},{"step":78,"speaker":"玩家","content":"的确如此，只不过据我了解……异方晶的附加产业，大多是高污染的工业化行业。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101076,"trial_step":76,"drawing":1050100},{"step":79,"options":["他们尤其多见于辛迪加"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101077,"trial_step":77,"course":3,"drawing":1050100,"choices":[{"text":"他们尤其多见于辛迪加","goto":78}]},{"step":80,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"当然，辛迪加曾经的辉煌，可都是这些东西带来的。","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_78"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101078,"trial_step":78,"drawing":1050100},{"step":81,"speaker":"玩家","content":"就算是如今的辛迪加，也还有很多人依旧在矿场里讨生活。哪怕这样的工作朝不保夕。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101079,"trial_step":79,"drawing":1050100},{"step":82,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"……这和我们之间所讨论的事情，有什么关系吗？","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_80"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101080,"trial_step":80,"drawing":1050100},{"step":83,"speaker":"玩家","content":"辛迪加如今风头正盛的一家金融风投机构，给了不少人下场挖矿的便利。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101081,"trial_step":81,"drawing":1050100},{"step":84,"speaker":"玩家","content":"同样在金融界叱咤风云的伊琳娜小姐，是否知道呢？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101082,"trial_step":82,"drawing":1050100},{"step":85,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"……略有耳闻。","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_83"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101083,"trial_step":83,"drawing":1050100},{"step":86,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"他们在向辛迪加的各个黑帮，收购矿区的所有权和开采权……然后开出高价回收的幌子，刺激他人下矿。","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_84"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101084,"trial_step":84,"drawing":1050100},{"step":87,"speaker":"玩家","content":"矿场所获得的利润丰厚。而且……有市场，就一定会有买卖。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101085,"trial_step":85,"drawing":1050100},{"step":88,"speaker":"玩家","content":"这也能算是“略有耳闻”么？我很想知道，既然您已经决定涉足异方晶的运输等附加产业……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101086,"trial_step":86,"drawing":1050100},{"step":89,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"难道你想让我说，我和这些矿场，和这家风投公司……有关系？","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_87"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101087,"trial_step":87,"drawing":1050100},{"step":90,"options":["正有此意"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101088,"trial_step":88,"course":3,"drawing":1050100,"choices":[{"text":"正有此意","goto":89}]},{"step":91,"content":"伊琳娜面无表情地看着你，但只维持了两秒——你听见伊琳娜优雅地笑了笑，继而直勾勾地看着你。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101089,"trial_step":89,"drawing":1050100},{"step":92,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"的确，我们和它有过交流。不过很遗憾，不是你脑海中的那种“交流”……","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_90"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101090,"trial_step":90,"drawing":1050100},{"step":93,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"愿意在辛迪加打拼的人，要么是些无耻歹人，要么是不安于现状的莽夫。","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_91"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101091,"trial_step":91,"drawing":1050100},{"step":94,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"但……不好意思，局长。奎恩不太愿意沾上这些苍蝇，所以我们之间没有达成过任何交易。","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_92"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101092,"trial_step":92,"drawing":1050100},{"step":95,"speaker":"玩家","content":"……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101093,"trial_step":93,"drawing":1050100},{"step":96,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"而且，你应该比我们更清楚，任何对奎恩的指控都是要讲证据的。","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_94"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101094,"trial_step":94,"drawing":1050100},{"step":97,"content":"伊琳娜饶有趣味地看着你，似乎是在等待着你下一步的动作。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101095,"trial_step":95,"drawing":1050100},{"step":98,"speaker":"玩家","content":"你认为管理局没有证据？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101096,"trial_step":96,"drawing":1050100},{"step":99,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"不然呢？我倒是很期待……您能凭空变出个证据来……","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_97"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101097,"trial_step":97,"drawing":1050100},{"step":100,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"说不定，这能成为我翻身的好东西。","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_98"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101098,"trial_step":98,"drawing":1050100},{"step":101,"content":"你重新将背靠向座椅的靠背，调整好自己的坐姿，朝伊琳娜开口。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101099,"trial_step":99,"drawing":1050100},{"step":102,"speaker":"玩家","content":"您的样子让我想起另一个人。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101100,"trial_step":100,"drawing":1050100},{"step":103,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"什么？","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_101"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101101,"trial_step":101,"drawing":1050100},{"step":104,"speaker":"玩家","content":"主持者","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101102,"trial_step":102,"drawing":1050100},{"step":105,"content":"你盯着伊琳娜不放，观察着她的每一个举动。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101103,"trial_step":103,"drawing":1050100},{"step":106,"speaker":"玩家","content":"伊琳娜小姐这么厉害，让我想起了那位颇负威名的家族企业领导者……普莱西·坎贝尔。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101104,"trial_step":104,"drawing":1050100},{"step":107,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"……这可是位大人物，我怎么能和他比呢？","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_105"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101105,"trial_step":105,"drawing":1050100},{"step":108,"content":"伊琳娜的手指动了动，继而拍了拍衣摆上并不存在的灰尘。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101106,"trial_step":106,"drawing":1050100},{"step":109,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"你问了很多奇怪但没有意义的问题，这就是MBCC的审查方式么？","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_107"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101107,"trial_step":107,"drawing":1050100},{"step":110,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"我可以接受你的监管，但我不接受无故的扣押。","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_108"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101108,"trial_step":108,"drawing":1050100},{"step":111,"speaker":"玩家","content":"你说的很有道理，伊琳娜小姐……MBCC从不无缘无故地抓人。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101109,"trial_step":109,"drawing":1050100},{"step":112,"speaker":"玩家","content":"要知道，狄斯城的外邦交易渠道一直是被外邦事务局严格管控的。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101110,"trial_step":110,"drawing":1050100},{"step":113,"content":"伊琳娜的脸色渐渐沉下去，沉默着一言不发。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101111,"trial_step":111,"drawing":1050100},{"step":114,"speaker":"玩家","content":"我有个疑问，伊琳娜小姐，你明明是新城人。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101112,"trial_step":112,"drawing":1050100},{"step":115,"speaker":"玩家","content":"新城的人向来不喜欢辛迪加，更不用说外邦的人，但你似乎不是这么想的。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101113,"trial_step":113,"drawing":1050100},{"step":116,"content":"测试音效的打断逻辑","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":114,"course":6,"drawing":1050100},{"step":117,"content":"播放一个长音效，会有个前奏，稍等一会儿。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":114,"course":6,"drawing":1050100},{"step":118,"content":"播放相同音效，会继续延续。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":114,"course":6,"drawing":1050100},{"step":119,"content":"暂停配置音效，这里测试一下打断。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":114,"course":6,"drawing":1050100},{"step":120,"content":"播放一个稍短的音效，在这里等待它结束。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":114,"course":6,"drawing":1050100},{"step":121,"content":"配置同名音效，看能否再次播放。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":114,"course":6,"drawing":1050100},{"step":122,"content":"结束测试。","style":18,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":114,"course":6,"drawing":1050100},{"step":123,"speaker":"玩家","content":"毕绍的人有百分之八十左右的人来自辛迪加，还有……外邦。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101115,"trial_step":115,"drawing":1050100},{"step":124,"speaker":"玩家","content":"您为什么要和一个外邦人超过半数的企业进行交流？哪怕这个交流最后无疾而终？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101116,"trial_step":116,"drawing":1050100},{"step":125,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"……","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_117"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101117,"trial_step":117,"drawing":1050100},{"step":126,"speaker":"玩家","content":"不说话对你没有任何好处，伊琳娜小姐。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101118,"trial_step":118,"drawing":1050100},{"step":127,"content":"伊琳娜把手撑在下颌处，深吸了一口气。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101119,"trial_step":119,"drawing":1050100},{"step":128,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"我说过了，在法律和道德最低允许的情况下，奎恩对于任何能够获得利益的生意都是来者不拒。","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_120"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101120,"trial_step":120,"drawing":1050100},{"step":129,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"对于外邦我当然颇有微词，但一码归一码，没有商人会在巨大的利益面前追求可悲的自傲与自尊。","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_121"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101121,"trial_step":121,"drawing":1050100},{"step":130,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"奎恩很爱惜自己的羽毛，虽然有过交流，但奎恩从未参与过与外邦任何货运贸易。","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_122"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101122,"trial_step":122,"drawing":1050100},{"step":131,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"还是那句话，局长大人。你如果要指控我，或者毕绍……得拿出证据，一锤定音的证据。","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_123"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101123,"trial_step":123,"drawing":1050100},{"step":132,"speaker":"玩家","content":"对外邦的货运交易，狄斯城不仅有专门的货运渠道，也有专门的货运清单，一般来说，交易的双方是狄斯城负责的议员和外邦的掌权者。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101124,"trial_step":124,"drawing":1050100},{"step":133,"speaker":"玩家","content":"在奎恩提交的货运清单中，我们发现了这个。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101125,"trial_step":125,"drawing":1050100},{"step":134,"content":"测试全屏类文本对演出效果的支持","style":14,"background":50409,"log_type":1,"src_id":3,"trial_step":126,"course":6,"drawing":1050100},{"step":135,"content":"转场…………………………………………………………………………","style":14,"background":50410,"log_type":1,"src_id":3,"trial_step":126,"course":6,"drawing":1050100},{"step":136,"content":"音效及语音…………………………………………………………………………","voice":["vo_cgplot_100002"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_00","style":14,"background":50410,"log_type":1,"src_id":3,"trial_step":126,"course":6,"drawing":1050100},{"step":137,"content":"一次性特效…………………………………………………………………………","style":14,"background":50410,"log_type":1,"src_id":3,"trial_step":126,"course":6,"drawing":1050100},{"step":138,"content":"循环特效…………………………………………………………………………","style":14,"background":50410,"log_type":1,"src_id":3,"trial_step":126,"course":6,"drawing":1050100},{"step":139,"content":"循环特效…………………………………………………………………………","style":14,"background":50410,"log_type":1,"src_id":3,"trial_step":126,"course":6,"drawing":1050100},{"step":140,"speaker":"玩家","content":"我想请问一下伊琳娜小姐，为何这张外邦与狄斯城的货运清单，会夹在奎恩的货运清单中？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101127,"trial_step":127,"drawing":1050100},{"step":141,"content":"你点了点放在桌面上的一张方形纸片，小小一张，上面挤满了信息。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101128,"trial_step":128,"drawing":1050100},{"step":142,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"我不知道。","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_129"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101129,"trial_step":129,"drawing":1050100},{"step":143,"speaker":"玩家","content":"“我不知道”这四个字，不是免死金牌，伊琳娜小姐。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101130,"trial_step":130,"drawing":1050100},{"step":144,"speaker":"玩家","content":"这种涉及FAC的货运生意，你应该不会放心地下放权力，将它交由下属代为操办吧？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101131,"trial_step":131,"drawing":1050100},{"step":145,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"要是局长无缘无故诬陷一个企业造假货运清单，我可以要求见我的律师吗？","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_132"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101132,"trial_step":132,"drawing":1050100},{"step":146,"speaker":"玩家","content":"当然可以，伊琳娜小姐。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101133,"trial_step":133,"drawing":1050100},{"step":147,"options":["但你为什么认为它是假的？"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101134,"trial_step":134,"course":3,"drawing":1050100,"choices":[{"text":"但你为什么认为它是假的？","goto":135}]},{"step":148,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"……","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_135"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101135,"trial_step":135,"drawing":1050100},{"step":149,"speaker":"玩家","content":"您对外邦有专门的货运清单这件事看起来一点都不惊讶……那我想问问，为何声称自己从未参与过的企业领导者，能这么波澜不惊，还能一眼看穿真假？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101136,"trial_step":136,"drawing":1050100},{"step":150,"content":"伊琳娜眯起眼睛，朝你扫视一番。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101137,"trial_step":137,"drawing":1050100},{"step":151,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"你在诈我？","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_138"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101138,"trial_step":138,"drawing":1050100},{"step":152,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"看来我们似乎是同道中人啊……为了达成目标……喜欢抛弃身段做一些不择手段的事……","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_139"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101139,"trial_step":139,"drawing":1050100},{"step":153,"speaker":"玩家","content":"我敢这么对您说话，也不过是因为……当知道我们在查这些事的时候。伊诺克议员，告诉了我们一些事情而已。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101140,"trial_step":140,"drawing":1050100},{"step":154,"content":"伊琳娜露出一丝慌乱，但很快又恢复原样。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101142,"trial_step":142,"drawing":1050102},{"step":155,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"那支录音笔，是伊诺克给你们的吧。","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_143"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101143,"trial_step":143,"drawing":1050100},{"step":156,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"你说的没错，奎恩确实跟外邦有一些交易往来，但那都是在……伊诺克议员的授意下进行的。","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_144"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101144,"trial_step":144,"drawing":1050100},{"step":157,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"如果你能拿到真正的货运清单，上面盖的章可都是伊诺克议员的名字。","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_145"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101145,"trial_step":145,"drawing":1050100},{"step":158,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"这并不能说明我与外邦有直接的交易关系。","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_146"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101146,"trial_step":146,"drawing":1050100},{"step":159,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"奎恩和外邦的货物，都要经过他的检查，才能放行。","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_147"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101147,"trial_step":147,"drawing":1050100},{"step":160,"options":["这批货很重要吗？"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101148,"trial_step":148,"course":3,"drawing":1050100,"choices":[{"text":"这批货很重要吗？","goto":149}]},{"step":161,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"为什么这么说？","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_149"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101149,"trial_step":149,"drawing":1050100},{"step":162,"speaker":"玩家","content":"我们提出要检查货物时，伊诺克议员很紧张，以至于我们要搬出第九机关的名头，才能继续下去。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101150,"trial_step":150,"drawing":1050100},{"step":163,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"唉……第九机关的名字还真是好用啊。","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_151"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101151,"trial_step":151,"drawing":1050102},{"step":164,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"伊诺克可能是为了保全那些货物，才把录音笔交给你吧……想不到，我也有成为弃子的一天。","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_152"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101152,"trial_step":152,"drawing":1050102},{"step":165,"speaker":"玩家","content":"既然如此，那就敞开来说说吧，伊琳娜小姐。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101153,"trial_step":153,"drawing":1050100},{"step":166,"speaker":"玩家","content":"伊诺克交给奎恩集团的货运渠道一共三条，分别对应三个不同的外邦。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101154,"trial_step":154,"drawing":1050100},{"step":167,"speaker":"玩家","content":"意在运输异方晶的同时，让狄斯城的其他工业产品与外邦也有往来生意。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101155,"trial_step":155,"drawing":1050100},{"step":168,"speaker":"玩家","content":"为了扶持外邦，狄斯城一般会要求外邦交易等价的生产原料或是生活用品。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101156,"trial_step":156,"drawing":1050100},{"step":169,"speaker":"玩家","content":"但在这次的调查中，用来交换的金属，无论是重量还是货物密度……似乎都不尽如人意。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101157,"trial_step":157,"drawing":1050100},{"step":170,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"费沙城的贵金属打捞作业，本就是一些用生命碰运气的活，有误差很正常。","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_158"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101158,"trial_step":158,"drawing":1050100},{"step":171,"speaker":"玩家","content":"很遗憾，伊诺克的伪装技术并不过关。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101159,"trial_step":159,"drawing":1050100},{"step":172,"speaker":"玩家","content":"同等重量的狄斯币，在某种意义上来说也确实是“贵金属”，你说对么，伊琳娜小姐？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101160,"trial_step":160,"drawing":1050100},{"step":173,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"……","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_161"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101161,"trial_step":161,"drawing":1050100},{"step":174,"speaker":"玩家","content":"除了狄斯币之外，我们还发现了一件很有意思的事。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101162,"trial_step":162,"drawing":1050100},{"step":175,"speaker":"玩家","content":"从伊诺克将货运渠道交给奎恩集团之后，奎恩集团突然主动调高了自己百分之五的税率，并积极参与各项慈善活动。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101163,"trial_step":163,"drawing":1050100},{"step":176,"speaker":"玩家","content":"在费沙城的货运单上，其中坎贝尔家族的货物税收，同时降低了五个百分点。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101164,"trial_step":164,"drawing":1050100},{"step":177,"speaker":"玩家","content":"这意味着费沙城每个月都多出百分之五的资金，去充实自己的各方面资源……甚至是军事资源——","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101165,"trial_step":165,"drawing":1050100},{"step":178,"speaker":"玩家","content":"也是在同年同时，白砂之海公海之上，沙盗活动趋于异常，与狄斯城的摩擦事故也逐渐增多。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101166,"trial_step":166,"drawing":1050100},{"step":179,"speaker":"玩家","content":"伊琳娜小姐难道还想说这是巧合吗？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101167,"trial_step":167,"drawing":1050100},{"step":180,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"看来，你查到不少。","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_168"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101168,"trial_step":168,"drawing":1050102},{"step":181,"content":"伊琳娜叹了一口气，有些脱力似地往后一靠。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101169,"trial_step":169,"drawing":1050102},{"step":182,"speaker":"玩家","content":"确实不少，所以让人不得不佩服伊琳娜小姐的能力。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101170,"trial_step":170,"drawing":1050102},{"step":183,"content":"听到你的夸赞，伊琳娜冷冷一笑。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101171,"trial_step":171,"drawing":1050102},{"step":184,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"我的能力……？","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_172"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101172,"trial_step":172,"drawing":1050102},{"step":185,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"只靠我和所谓的异能，可完全没办法成就奎恩这个商业帝国。","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_173"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101173,"trial_step":173,"drawing":1050102},{"step":186,"content":"在伊琳娜说完这句话后，审查室再次陷入沉寂。就在微光中的灰尘都要停滞的时候，伊琳娜再次开了口。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101174,"trial_step":174,"drawing":1050102},{"step":187,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"奎恩集团渗透了狄斯城的很多方面，经济、生活、科技……甚至还有军备。","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_175"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101175,"trial_step":175,"drawing":1050102},{"step":188,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"但这些，都仰仗了我的父亲——普莱西·坎贝尔的“帮助”。","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_176"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101176,"trial_step":176,"drawing":1050102},{"step":189,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"除了他，还能有谁能在这么短的时间内，创建一个商业帝国呢？就算是他的亲生女儿，也绝对不可能做到。","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_177"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101177,"trial_step":177,"drawing":1050102},{"step":190,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"父亲让我来到新城，借我之手完成了在新城的商业建设，将新城作为他的补给仓……","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_178"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101178,"trial_step":178,"drawing":1050102},{"step":191,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"货运贸易做手脚是我父亲要求的，包括该收买什么样的人也一样。","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_179"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101179,"trial_step":179,"drawing":1050102},{"step":192,"content":"叹息一般的苦笑声从伊琳娜的喉咙里溢出，她撑着自己靠在椅背上，一脸落寞。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101180,"trial_step":180,"drawing":1050102},{"step":193,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"可能你们不知道，伊诺克是唯一一个，我没听父亲的话，凭借自己的判断来操作的，结果就栽在了他手上。","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_181"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101181,"trial_step":181,"drawing":1050102},{"step":194,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"我并非不知道这些事将会给城市，还有我自己带来何种危险性。","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_182"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101182,"trial_step":182,"drawing":1050102},{"step":195,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"但……我没有办法，我想不出来其他更好的办法。","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_183"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101183,"trial_step":183,"drawing":1050102},{"step":196,"content":"伊琳娜移开视线，盯着自己脚底的一块地板。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101184,"trial_step":184,"drawing":1050102},{"step":197,"content":"这个屹立在如今新城商业帝国巅峰的女强人，此刻尽显自己的脆弱。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101185,"trial_step":185,"drawing":1050102},{"step":198,"content":"她像一只逃离樊笼，却挣脱不了脚上锁链的金丝雀，无助地降落在此。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101186,"trial_step":186,"drawing":1050102},{"step":199,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"我的父亲用尽一切手段，仅用八年便坐上了当代家主的位置。","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_187"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101187,"trial_step":187,"drawing":1050102},{"step":200,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"而那些“手段”中，不乏自己的骨肉……我能侥幸逃过，大概也不过是因为，我曾在一盘西洋棋局中，与他打了个不相上下吧。","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_188"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101188,"trial_step":188,"drawing":1050102},{"step":201,"content":"普莱西·坎贝尔。就连你也在各种各样的场合里听人讨论过，资料上也花费了诸多笔墨，去描述他的手段。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101189,"trial_step":189,"drawing":1050102},{"step":202,"content":"一个城市的主人，有着令人闻风丧胆的威名。但你确实没有想到，他对自己的女儿也是这般恶毒。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101190,"trial_step":190,"drawing":1050102},{"step":203,"options":["为什么不摆脱他的控制？"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101191,"trial_step":191,"course":3,"drawing":1050102,"choices":[{"text":"为什么不摆脱他的控制？","goto":192}]},{"step":204,"speaker":"玩家","content":"如今你已经进入新城，应该有的是机会才对。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101192,"trial_step":192,"drawing":1050102},{"step":205,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"你以为我没有尝试过吗？","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_193"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101193,"trial_step":193,"drawing":1050102},{"step":206,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"只有尝试过后才知道，做一颗棋子，是最安全的。","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_194"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101194,"trial_step":194,"drawing":1050102},{"step":207,"options":["可你是他的女儿","可你是禁闭者"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101195,"trial_step":195,"course":3,"drawing":1050102,"choices":[{"text":"可你是他的女儿","goto":200},{"text":"可你是禁闭者","goto":196}]},{"step":208,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"那又如何？","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_196"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101196,"trial_step":196,"drawing":1050102},{"step":209,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"甚至如今我觉醒成了禁闭者，他也丝毫不畏惧。","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_197"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101197,"trial_step":197,"drawing":1050102},{"step":210,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"他只会跟我说，这样一来，我就有能力将辛迪加的市场也开拓开来。","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_198"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101198,"trial_step":198,"drawing":1050102},{"step":211,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"那些黑帮手里，可掌握着不小的资源量。","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_199"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101199,"trial_step":199,"drawing":1050102,"next":[204]},{"step":212,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"那又如何……","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_200"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101200,"trial_step":200,"drawing":1050102},{"step":213,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"你真的会用自己这样可怕的能力，对着自己的亲生父亲吗？","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_201"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101201,"trial_step":201,"drawing":1050102},{"step":214,"speaker":"玩家","content":"即使他威胁你的性命？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101202,"trial_step":202,"drawing":1050102},{"step":215,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"……","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_203"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101203,"trial_step":203,"drawing":1050102},{"step":216,"speaker":"伊琳娜","content":"这场父女关系里，一厢情愿地心软的，只有我而已。","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_204"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101204,"trial_step":204,"drawing":1050102},{"step":217,"content":"伊琳娜的坦白，宣告着新城最大的商业机构、甚至有一定能力想要去涉足异方晶产业的商业财团……与外邦勾结，这并非小事。你决定先暂停此次审查，从长计议。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101205,"trial_step":205,"drawing":1050102},{"step":218,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"您相信她的话吗？","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_206"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101206,"trial_step":206,"drawing":1050102},{"step":219,"options":["不相信","相信"],"style":6,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101207,"trial_step":207,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"不相信","goto":208},{"text":"相信","goto":null}]},{"step":220,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"那为什么……","voice":["vo_trial_50101_1_208"],"voice_bank":"vo_heli_trial","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101208,"trial_step":208},{"step":221,"speaker":"玩家","content":"我不相信的是她的目的……普莱西的手就算能伸这么长，置身于外邦这么久，不可能密不透风地将新城掌握在自己手里，但她却说所有的事都是由自己的父亲授意办成的。","style":2,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101209,"trial_step":209},{"step":222,"content":"你看着资料下方的DNA检测报告，那张报告本来是你打算击溃伊琳娜谎言的最后一张王牌，此刻却显得有些绵软无力。","style":3,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101210,"trial_step":210},{"step":223,"speaker":"玩家","content":"她是个很聪明的人，并且我不相信一个如此聪明的禁闭者会任由普通人操作……哪怕这个人是她的父亲。","style":2,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101211,"trial_step":211},{"step":224,"content":"你稍加思索，将审查内容写入报告，连夜送去第九机关——","style":3,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101212,"trial_step":212},{"step":225,"content":"报告中，你明确指出了普莱西的危险性和调查的必要性，他既然连禁闭者都能操控的话，背后说不定会有实力同等与禁闭者的势力在。","style":3,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101213,"trial_step":213},{"step":226,"content":"并且，你认为，伊琳娜既然愿意主动说出真相，那便有一定的投诚可能——\n你申请了禁闭者外出许可，你希望能带着伊琳娜回一趟费沙城。","style":3,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":150101214,"trial_step":214}]}